  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Halve snacking tomatoes. Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f868cfcade9b9f0aceccd8/step-de4af300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook plant-based mince and Mediterranean seasoning, breaking up with a spoon, until browned and cooked through, 4-5 minutes. <br>• Remove pan from heat and add the honey and a splash of water, tossing to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f868cfcade9b9f0aceccd8/step-cdfb4210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Microwave pita bread on a microwave-safe plate for 1 minute, until warmed through. <br>• In a large bowl, combine snacking tomatoes, cucumber, spinach &amp; rocket mix and green dressing. Season with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f868cfcade9b9f0aceccd8/step-f1e9b920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Halve pita bread and spread with garlic aioli. Fill with Mediterranean plant-based mince and some cherry tomato salad. <br>• Crumble over fetta cubes. Serve with remaining salad. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f868cfcade9b9f0aceccd8/step-e4a2ee30.jpg"
    }
  ]
